                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a1070937-73f8-3431-b841-10386d000d15",
                        "entry_id": "eca24e70-3b83-39d1-b89d-eeda6b06436d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "истор. представитель кочующего народа; кочевник"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c0afbe79-4016-4446-be15-e9325b236d6a",
                                "sense_id": "a1070937-73f8-3431-b841-10386d000d15",
                                "text": "У номадов и прирожденных авантюристов этот огонек превращается в пожирающее пламя, но у меня он, вероятно, только тлел, как и полагается у культурного юноши, который отечеству на пользу и родителям на утешение; и никуда я не поехал, пока не окончил всех полагавшихся мне курсов"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eadba202-360b-461e-b64d-dc532a804260",
                        "source_entry_id": "eca24e70-3b83-39d1-b89d-eeda6b06436d",
                        "source_sense_id": "a1070937-73f8-3431-b841-10386d000d15",
                        "target_lang_word": "nomad",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nomad",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7996c894-d50e-3bfb-9fd0-e957fbf12f08",
                                        "entry_id": "79dc79dc-b34a-332f-ac18-711f966871ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of a society or class who herd animals from pasture to pasture with no fixed home."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36cdc455-13a9-4ab7-981a-f930895236a5",
                                                "sense_id": "7996c894-d50e-3bfb-9fd0-e957fbf12f08",
                                                "text": "The life of the people called the Nomads or Grazyers..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd58e2d5-366b-48ce-a74c-3c662936f70d",
                                                "sense_id": "7996c894-d50e-3bfb-9fd0-e957fbf12f08",
                                                "text": "Energy has seldom been found where we need it when we want it. Ancient nomads, wishing to ward off the evening chill and enjoy a meal around a campfire, had to collect wood and then spend time and effort coaxing the heat of friction out from between sticks to kindle a flame. With more settled people, animals were harnessed to capstans or caged in treadmills to turn grist into meal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1b586ffb-5f03-3deb-8566-dd1a2e0a966d",
                                        "entry_id": "79dc79dc-b34a-332f-ac18-711f966871ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of wanderer: an itinerant person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "70d93a3b-e8c2-3721-b325-594828ac2329",
                                        "entry_id": "79dc79dc-b34a-332f-ac18-711f966871ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who changes residence frequently."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a1c7d96-bbc4-402d-a878-241e06f57b1e",
                                                "sense_id": "70d93a3b-e8c2-3721-b325-594828ac2329",
                                                "text": "Poise is the posture of the nomad, moving while always at home."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18494057-1bfb-4e0b-afd9-bae1ae667fcc",
                                                "sense_id": "70d93a3b-e8c2-3721-b325-594828ac2329",
                                                "text": "Once again Judy was a nomad, moving to yet again another destination."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "489ad118-d231-44e9-ad76-c8873add581a",
                                                "sense_id": "70d93a3b-e8c2-3721-b325-594828ac2329",
                                                "text": "I made my exit down I-75, heading south. After a 40-year odyssey as a media nomad, I will be closing the circle in a place where my life had never been better."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c91b30c-48ad-39e0-9bc6-fbc306549bc7",
                                        "entry_id": "79dc79dc-b34a-332f-ac18-711f966871ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A player who changes teams frequently."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82f8b936-928d-4881-8bc0-6b5e4a1aca81",
                                                "sense_id": "4c91b30c-48ad-39e0-9bc6-fbc306549bc7",
                                                "text": "With the recruitment of South Australian football nomad, and eventual legend of the game, Phil Matson, Subiaco would improve considerably in 1912."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d32b7737-f193-4dd6-9307-5873fff9f705",
                                                "sense_id": "4c91b30c-48ad-39e0-9bc6-fbc306549bc7",
                                                "text": "Unlike players who were often traded, baseball nomads who carried a hobo's bindle rather than a bat on their shoulders, Musial stayed put in St. Louis."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31c98af4-fefb-488c-a1db-7ee509e6eaea",
                                                "sense_id": "4c91b30c-48ad-39e0-9bc6-fbc306549bc7",
                                                "text": "Between 1996 and 2003, Lewis was a baseball nomad. At various times he signed contracts with San Diego, Detroit, Oakland, Cincinnati, Philadelphia, the New York Mets, Cleveland, and the Chicago Cubs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "39fdaf05-6398-313e-b4ee-3ce33acacebf",
                                        "entry_id": "79dc79dc-b34a-332f-ac18-711f966871ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A dragonfly of Afroeurasia, Sympetrum fonscolombii."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "nomad",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "57328384-b08d-3abd-9d6d-b05f1efae262",
                                        "entry_id": "20f6990c-a641-3b85-a440-1af76b4c567b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of nomadic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9808b784-170c-4ff4-9ed8-29d35713813f",
                        "source_entry_id": "eca24e70-3b83-39d1-b89d-eeda6b06436d",
                        "source_sense_id": "a1070937-73f8-3431-b841-10386d000d15",
                        "target_lang_word": "nómada",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nómada",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "06172711-7838-37bb-bc3f-cfa2cd1b9a3c",
                                        "entry_id": "d4e7b080-8c1f-3c2f-b6da-ca237943afac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Aquél que está constantemente desplazándose de un lugar a otro, sin rumbo ni domicilio fijo."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18dc79bb-0614-4519-816a-24cefb026802",
                                                "sense_id": "06172711-7838-37bb-bc3f-cfa2cd1b9a3c",
                                                "text": "Los cazadores paleolíticos eran nómadas porque debían seguir las huellas de la caza, si querían sobrevivir"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6e122d68-080c-4dab-a68b-738250d843cf",
                        "source_entry_id": "eca24e70-3b83-39d1-b89d-eeda6b06436d",
                        "source_sense_id": "a1070937-73f8-3431-b841-10386d000d15",
                        "target_lang_word": "nomade",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nomade",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9226b7a0-6698-3fb6-b1ed-015ddae3132f",
                                        "entry_id": "c8589edc-14c9-3315-8bd1-e1156b58db76",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est errant, itinérant ; qui n’a pas d’habitation fixe, surtout en parlant des nations, des tribus, des peuplades."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "216dd701-c4db-4b63-b95e-659ae29c567f",
                                                "sense_id": "9226b7a0-6698-3fb6-b1ed-015ddae3132f",
                                                "text": "Il connaissait les procédés violents de ces chasseurs nomades, et il pensait que mieux valait, en tout cas, se mettre à l’abri d’un coup de main."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8a56923-6918-40fa-8ef3-ba816c33500f",
                                                "sense_id": "9226b7a0-6698-3fb6-b1ed-015ddae3132f",
                                                "text": "Les habitants passagers des garnis qui constituent la population nomade de Paris ne représentent malheureusement pas à eux seuls la population misérable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd16d588-2d72-4c5f-9a05-003b02560db0",
                                                "sense_id": "9226b7a0-6698-3fb6-b1ed-015ddae3132f",
                                                "text": "Les marchands nomades, notamment, cherchent à circonvenir par tous les moyens, tous ceux faisant métier de vérifier les animaux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9bb46b4c-e252-4cde-a63a-0f7a30299bdb",
                                                "sense_id": "9226b7a0-6698-3fb6-b1ed-015ddae3132f",
                                                "text": "L’origine de cette espèce asiatique a été très discutée : suivant De Candolle et divers auteurs, elle serait originaire des pays caspiens et aurait suivi en Europe les migrations des tribus nomades des Zingaris."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5f4154e6-4740-331b-9d14-16b831726c42",
                                        "entry_id": "c8589edc-14c9-3315-8bd1-e1156b58db76",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relatif aux nomades et au nomadisme."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49d36933-8029-47ac-b295-02583ccf9619",
                                                "sense_id": "5f4154e6-4740-331b-9d14-16b831726c42",
                                                "text": "Je me rendis avec les chefs militaires aux tentes de Si Saïd, où on nous servit une collation de dattes et de lait de chamelle, une vieille tradition nomade sans doute."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7245ecb7-0225-3f35-91a5-aa96fb702db0",
                                        "entry_id": "c8589edc-14c9-3315-8bd1-e1156b58db76",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualifie les animaux qui changent de lieu suivant les saisons."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Plus rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "nomade",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8d3da96c-80e3-31b2-beae-63975c4340ed",
                                        "entry_id": "d1ed7b75-ef77-383b-b74c-4d62d893cbe7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Membre d’un peuple qui n’a pas d’habitation fixe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17549b61-3fb9-4d51-ad72-0993dfdfe05c",
                                                "sense_id": "8d3da96c-80e3-31b2-beae-63975c4340ed",
                                                "text": "Les nomades gardaient des troupeaux de yaks et de moutons appartenant en grande partie aux classes privilégiées."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b0e4b4b-dc01-4f5f-9135-027d73726985",
                                                "sense_id": "8d3da96c-80e3-31b2-beae-63975c4340ed",
                                                "text": "D'ailleurs, le choix fait de mettre un terme aux rezzous procédait directement de cet atavisme ethnique voulant que le nomade « vive sur la bête », en l'occurrence sur le sédentaire, à l'image du laborator médiéval dont le destin était d'assurer l'entretien du bellator."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c691cb71-b780-3c09-b908-56f78fd45e45",
                                        "entry_id": "d1ed7b75-ef77-383b-b74c-4d62d893cbe7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Celui ou celle qui change souvent de pays, d’habitation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cb659c46-801c-3e12-8dd7-4b2bbb61dbfe",
                                        "entry_id": "d1ed7b75-ef77-383b-b74c-4d62d893cbe7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Celui ou celle qui se déplace souvent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "hyperbole"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9efc8c9-15e7-454d-932e-8daec3358c56",
                                                "sense_id": "cb659c46-801c-3e12-8dd7-4b2bbb61dbfe",
                                                "text": "Les éléments du tableau semblent saisis par l'agitation vibrionnaire des nomades de la nuit. Rien n’est concerté, personne ne se rencontre, tous retournent à leur errance, le tableau demeure."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cd1a97df-b18a-3497-a76d-db258fa8d5c7",
                                        "entry_id": "d1ed7b75-ef77-383b-b74c-4d62d893cbe7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Abeille coucou d’apparence vespiforme appartenant au genre Nomada."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "134c00ac-e875-42c6-a176-718fd1a4d880",
                                                "sense_id": "cd1a97df-b18a-3497-a76d-db258fa8d5c7",
                                                "text": "Parmi les premières, il en est qui, parasites, ne travaillent point d’elles-mêmes, mais savent mettre à profit le travail des autres ; tels sont la plupart des abeilles nomades, quelques abeilles mégachiles et entr’autres l’abeille conique noire, qui dépose ses œufs dans le nid d’autres abeilles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
